WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:03.959
Toad struggled under his friends.

2
00:00:03.960 --> 00:00:07.512
"Get off me!" he screamed.

3
00:00:07.513 --> 00:00:11.712
"You have no right! Help! Help!"

4
00:00:11.713 --> 00:00:15.810
"Hold still, Toad," said Mole.

5
00:00:15.811 --> 00:00:20.773
Finally they got Toad out of his coat and cap.

6
00:00:20.774 --> 00:00:24.827
The goggles and gloves lay on the floor.

7
00:00:24.828 --> 00:00:28.069
"Now stand up, Toad," said Mole.

8
00:00:28.070 --> 00:00:31.515
"You look like yourself again."

9
00:00:31.516 --> 00:00:34.781
Toad calmed down.

10
00:00:34.782 --> 00:00:38.598
In fact, he even giggled a little.

11
00:00:38.599 --> 00:00:42.572
"Toad, you knew we would come," said Badger.

12
00:00:42.573 --> 00:00:45.190
"We warned you!" said Rat.

13
00:00:45.191 --> 00:00:49.147
"You are spending all your money," said Mole.

14
00:00:49.148 --> 00:00:51.565
"But . . . ," said Toad.

15
00:00:51.566 --> 00:00:55.531
"You are getting a bad name," said Badger.

16
00:00:55.532 --> 00:00:58.026
"But . . . ," said Toad.

17
00:00:58.027 --> 00:01:01.454
"The police are always after you," said Rat.

18
00:01:01.455 --> 00:01:04.312
"But . . . ," said Toad.

19
00:01:04.313 --> 00:01:10.038
"You are a terrible driver!" cried Mole.

20
00:01:10.039 --> 00:01:13.731
Toad looked down sadly.

21
00:01:13.732 --> 00:01:17.425
"Toad, we don't think you're bad," said Rat.

22
00:01:17.426 --> 00:01:21.651
"But you must give up your cars," said Badger.

23
00:01:21.652 --> 00:01:26.828
"Then everything will be right again," said Mole.

24
00:01:26.829 --> 00:01:30.733
Badger put his hand on Toad's shoulder.

25
00:01:30.734 --> 00:01:34.607
"Let's go into the next room," he said.

26
00:01:34.608 --> 00:01:38.795
"We won't come out until you make a promise.

27
00:01:38.796 --> 00:01:43.523
You must promise to stop driving."

28
00:01:43.524 --> 00:01:47.327
Badger led Toad into the next room.

29
00:01:47.328 --> 00:01:50.264
He closed the door.

30
00:01:50.265 --> 00:01:53.154
"It's useless," sighed Rat.

31
00:01:53.155 --> 00:01:55.408
"Talking does nothing.

32
00:01:55.409 --> 00:01:59.421
Toad will say anything!"

